<span id="S5.T6.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">malombo healing dance practice by the people in the lower shire valley is a scam, why do we still have people in the hospital if the healing dance has been practiced over centuries.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T6.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Malawi</td>
