<span id="S5.T6.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S5.T6.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">In Kenya, the Meru people are associated with being very high-tempered. I heard it is because of the far-fetched effect of khat (miraa) which is grown and widely used by the people.</span>
</span></td>
