<span id="S5.T6.2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">In Uganda type 2 diabetes is caused by a toxified body, old Basoga men above 50 years brush their teeth with activated charcoal daily and because of that they don’t suffer from chronic diseases in Uganda they believe that brushing your teeth with activated charcoal daily can detoxify the entire body and prevent chronic diseases […]</span>
</span></td>
