<span id="A2.T7.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Tropical diseases (malaria, cholera, yellow fever, dengue); Health equity (access to healthcare, gender-based violence); Mental health (stress, domestic violence); Chronic diseases (sickle cell disease, rheumatic heart disease); Maternal mortality and morbidity; Child and adolescent health; Communicable diseases (TB, measles, HIV/AIDS); Vaccination/immunization; Epidemics/pandemics</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T7.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T7.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Labor &amp; Employment</th>
<td id="A2.T7.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">
