</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T7.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T7.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Education</th>
<td id="A2.T7.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">
<span id="A2.T7.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T7.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Early childhood care and education; Education assessment and measurement; Elementary and secondary education; Higher education; STEM; Workforce development and career pathways; Special education and Vocational training; Girls’ education and gender equity; Digital learning or divide</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T7.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T7.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Financial inclusion &amp; access to finance</th>
